SUMMARY:Meet Your Plant Neighbors
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for an exploration of White Pines Nature Preserve!\nWhat plants do we live amongst\, and what are their names? On this hike\, we'll amble along the White Pines Trail down to the confluence of the Deep & Rocky Rivers\, identifying plants along the way. We'll meet native Piedmont trees\, shrubs\, and herbs\, as well as some mountain region species that are thriving in the microclimate of White Pines Preserve.\n\nThis will be a 2-3 mile hike with a decent amount of topographical change. This is a free event\, but preregistration is required.\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please fill out the waitlist form here by June 17th at noon. 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/meet-your-plant-neighbors
LOCATION:White Pines Nature Preserve\, 548 S Rocky River Rd\, Sanford\, NC\, 27330\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
