SUMMARY:Nature Storytime: Wonders of our Waters
DESCRIPTION:Discover the wonders of our waters at our monthly Nature Storytime!\nEnter a secret underwater world and learn how to protect it with nature stories\, nature games\, and a fun romp down to the pond at Williamson Nature Preserve. Join a TLC educator for this monthly story series where you can meet other families in your community and learn about nature. \n\nThis month's nature stories are: We Are Water Protectors by Carole Lindstrom\, and Over and Under the Pond by Kate Messner.\n\nThis free program is designed for kids age 3-7 and their grownups. Please register all members of the family attending\, including children and adults:\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please email Meera Butalia at mbutalia@triangleland.org to be added to the waitlist.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/nature-storytime-wonders-of-our-waters
LOCATION:Williamson Farm and Nature Preserve\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, 27610\, United States
END:VEVENT
